{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable content in the demo version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb24 types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb24 types of abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlayer inflation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEnemy inflation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbImplementation up to Ascension Level 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following elements will not be included in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Addition of weapons and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Balance adjustments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 UI updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlocking of certain features such as the help panel and window size adjustments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascention Suvivor is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a roguelike action game where you defeat approaching enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of 20 stages, and the enemies become stronger (sometimes even stronger than the player).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/c4314ea636fe47781ec3c73e684f82f6.poster.avif?t=1754804195\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/c4314ea636fe47781ec3c73e684f82f6.webm?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/c4314ea636fe47781ec3c73e684f82f6.mp4?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 types of weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use coins to buy weapons and fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/9f8ceb111079f89bac92f35cbd5e0ca3.poster.avif?t=1754804195\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/9f8ceb111079f89bac92f35cbd5e0ca3.webm?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/9f8ceb111079f89bac92f35cbd5e0ca3.mp4?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not enough firepower with weapons alone? Customize your weapons with abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire (1+2)\u00d72\u00d72\u00d72\u00d72 magic bullets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the screen with fire effects?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the strongest combination, inflate your firepower, and defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/f6464b2cd8c460e2bbc81156ec32acfc.poster.avif?t=1754804195\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/f6464b2cd8c460e2bbc81156ec32acfc.webm?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/f6464b2cd8c460e2bbc81156ec32acfc.mp4?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies Inflate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies become stronger each time you clear a stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that were not a threat suddenly become harmful characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/98265cdc994fa77553ce95c1a939a282.poster.avif?t=1754804195\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/98265cdc994fa77553ce95c1a939a282.webm?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/extras/98265cdc994fa77553ce95c1a939a282.mp4?t=1754804195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905420?t=1754804195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905420?t=1754804195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/c05de1df490976074fc08d9131974a3fc538677b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754804195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905420/c05de1df490976074fc08d9131974a3fc538677b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754804195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable content in the demo version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb24 types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb24 types of abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlayer inflation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEnemy inflation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbImplementation up to Ascension Level 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following elements will not be included in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Addition of we